  "id": "dynamic-attributes",
  "title": "Dynamic attributes",
  "summary": "An attribute whose name starts with `:` takes an expression as its value. Braces work only in text, not in attribute values. To build an attribute from text and a value, join them in the expression, as in `:class=\"'status-' + link.state\"`. The build refuses braces in a plain attribute with `TY1313`.",
